        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12532453/comment/13155831",
          "id": "13155831",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mduerig",
            "name": "mduerig",
            "key": "mduerig",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael D\u00fcrig",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Bucharest"
          },
          "body": "Group#getMembers() does not pose a uniqueness constraint on the returned iterator. So the current implementation is to the contract. Since uniqueness is desirable I think we should also tighten that contract. \n\nHowever, adding uniqueness will partially undo the gains from collecting group members lazily since the implementation would have to remember members in order to test for uniqueness. ",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mduerig",
            "name": "mduerig",
            "key": "mduerig",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=mduerig&avatarId=13834"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael D\u00fcrig",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Bucharest"
          },
          "created": "2011-11-23T12:16:38.993+0000",
          "updated": "2011-11-23T12:16:38.993+0000"
        },
        {
